    "enUS": {
      "description": "I have concocted a lovely serum that our new guest is sure to find quite... stimulating.\r\n\r\nTake this. Feed it into the workings dripping from above him. Let's see if we can't show him why it's in his best interest to serve loyally.\r\n\r\nAnd try not to drop it. I can't afford a new assistant.",
